    Bug 1983982 - Add telemetry to record the addition of certificate exceptions. r=aleca,freaktechnik
    There are other call sites I haven't added telemetry to: IM, Feeds, and address book search.
    In those cases I expect the volume is so low as to not be worth it. There's also the Certificate
    Manager in about:preferences, which is toolkit code, so I can't change it.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D261684

